# Tests match the module, not the ticket

- `tracks.ts` → `tracks.test.ts` in the same folder.
- Do not name files or folders after the ticket, slice, or epic (`catalog.test.ts` for KIND-49).
- Do not add a leftover file that only exists because of the ticket name.
